---
title: "transferInvestorPosition (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: transferInvestorPosition(from, to)
    q_check_auth --> q_check_source: caller is Legion operator
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_check_source --> q_check_dest: investorPosition[from].investedCapital > 0
    q_check_source --> q_revert_source: source position invalid
    q_check_dest --> q_check_not_claimed: investorPosition[to].investedCapital == 0
    q_check_dest --> q_revert_dest: destination already has position
    q_check_not_claimed --> q_transfer_data: investorPosition[from].hasSettled == false
    q_check_not_claimed --> q_revert_claimed: position already settled
    q_transfer_data --> q_clear_source: investorPosition[to] = investorPosition[from]
    q_clear_source --> q_emit: delete investorPosition[from]
    q_emit --> [*]: emit PositionTransferred(from, to)
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert UnauthorizedAccess
    q_revert_source --> [*]: revert InvalidSourcePosition
    q_revert_dest --> [*]: revert DestinationHasPosition
    q_revert_claimed --> [*]: revert PositionAlreadySettled

    note right of q_transfer_data
        INV-001: position data integrity preserved during transfer
        INV-002: source position zeroed after transfer
        INV-003: total invested capital unchanged by position transfer
    end note
